 \, jet boat\, I/O's and the family ski boat all compete in the marathon ev
 ent.Nascar-style pit stops allow for fueling and driver changes during the
  race.\n\nEvent website: https://rpmracingent.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listin
 g: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/2025-blue-water-resort-casino-bit-p
