DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271016
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271025
DTSTAMP:20261027T164440Z
UID:49d7cc0a815e2fc44134c9a6@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:An immersive celebration of art set against the awe-inspiring 
 red rock landscapes of Sedona. As one of the oldest continuously running p
 lein air festivals in the western United States\, this iconic event brings
  together master artists from across the country to paint on location and 
 share their talents with the public during Sedona’s most beautiful seaso
 n. The festival features a week of outdoor painting\, special exhibitions\
